OL,3,AJudge temporarily overturns Trump's
OL,4,AWhite House media ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA federal judge has ordered the Trump
OL,7,Fadministration to immediately reinstate
OL,8,Faccess to the White House for three
OL,9,Fnews organisations barred from the
OL,10,Fbuilding last week by the president.
OL,12,FCNN, MS NOW and Politico must have
OL,13,Ftheir access restored for 14 days, the
OL,14,Fjudge ruled, saying the ban "likely
OL,15,Fviolated their constitutional due
OL,16,Fprocess rights". Some reporters from
OL,17,Fthe outlets said were turned away on
OL,18,FThursday morning.
OL,20,FThe three outlets launched a legal
OL,21,Fchallenge after their reporters were
OL,22,Fdenied access last weekend.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
